{"steam_appid":1674200,"steam_name":"Alaska Gold Fever","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1674200/1902018362/f8672b95f2658cebcf73cb90260b05b563b2511d/1776161461/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1776173596","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257319460/86effcadf44f9189998f023979da87dcc25acf76/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1776173596","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674200/469b2bfc216b511db09cebb28200453825bc41bf/ss_469b2bfc216b511db09cebb28200453825bc41bf.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786636382","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674200/58a88c2aaa5b3a9608979a67267999f77fb4405d/ss_58a88c2aaa5b3a9608979a67267999f77fb4405d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786636382","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674200/2ca32d111dfbc5bc7eb726d5a90c09c773a65592/ss_2ca32d111dfbc5bc7eb726d5a90c09c773a65592.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786636382","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674200/c3a7d0b981cef2f04d269a8c8770f9ee2861e0f0/ss_c3a7d0b981cef2f04d269a8c8770f9ee2861e0f0.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786636382","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674200/07c75e3a839caebdbdff630d87f2c3ec37c3a2f9/ss_07c75e3a839caebdbdff630d87f2c3ec37c3a2f9.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786636382"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674200/extras/37e181a6adef0ff5fbff39dbbd12e42d.poster.avif?t=1786636382\" width=1170 height=582 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674200/extras/37e181a6adef0ff5fbff39dbbd12e42d.webm?t=1786636382\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674200/extras/37e181a6adef0ff5fbff39dbbd12e42d.mp4?t=1786636382\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Mine Gold Like During the Real Gold Rush!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674200/extras/ea2d9d28f2c8049e0a6dbe5f99071218.poster.avif?t=1786636382\" width=1170 height=496 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674200/extras/ea2d9d28f2c8049e0a6dbe5f99071218.webm?t=1786636382\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674200/extras/ea2d9d28f2c8049e0a6dbe5f99071218.mp4?t=1786636382\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a gold mining process inspired by historical methods from the gold rush era.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break rocks, collect ore, and separate gold from the soil using various tools and machines. Then smelt it into gold bars that you can sell at the bank.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the game you will find different forms of gold:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >gold dust</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >gold flakes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >gold nuggets</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each type has a different value and requires the proper refining process. As you progress through the game, you will unlock better tools and mining techniques.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">A System of Mines to Discover</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674200/extras/11bac16fee7b4e54c860c78383cdf39b.poster.avif?t=1786636382\" width=1170 height=496 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674200/extras/11bac16fee7b4e54c860c78383cdf39b.webm?t=1786636382\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674200/extras/11bac16fee7b4e54c860c78383cdf39b.mp4?t=1786636382\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game you can discover and explore a total of 9 mines.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 small mines for quick expeditions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 medium mines with branching tunnels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 large multi-level mine</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each mine has its own unique atmosphere and several to dozens of segments to discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Working in a mine is dangerous. If you do not place supports correctly, tunnels may collapse. Build reinforcement structures, expand your infrastructure, and explore deeper underground.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Upgrade Tools and Equipment</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674200/extras/691aa9fbc90c7fce792c9949a6fb6801.poster.avif?t=1786636382\" width=1170 height=496 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674200/extras/691aa9fbc90c7fce792c9949a6fb6801.webm?t=1786636382\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674200/extras/691aa9fbc90c7fce792c9949a6fb6801.mp4?t=1786636382\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your tools determine how fast and efficiently you can mine gold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create upgraded versions of your equipment and enhance them using rare materials and gemstones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Possible upgrades include:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >increased tool durability</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >faster resource extraction</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ability to break harder rock</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >additional equipment upgrades</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Alaska, 1896 – A Rich Storyline</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674200/extras/d62688db21f7e672432750efb72b1775.poster.avif?t=1786636382\" width=1170 height=496 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674200/extras/d62688db21f7e672432750efb72b1775.webm?t=1786636382\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674200/extras/d62688db21f7e672432750efb72b1775.mp4?t=1786636382\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thousands of people arrive in northern America in search of fortune. Most will return empty-handed. Only a few will make history. Maybe you will be one of them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Alaska Gold Fever you start as an ordinary gold prospector with simple tools and a big dream. Explore the wild lands of Alaska, mine gold, hunt, develop your businesses, and build an empire at the edge of 19th-century civilization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game you can expect many interesting and engaging storylines as well as unusual characters, such as the Pastor. A large number of fascinating stories and quests await you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a main storyline</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >side quests</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >hidden treasures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >mysterious locations</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Crafting and Survival</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674200/extras/819f4208e4e48f098bd638f92200355f.poster.avif?t=1786636382\" width=1170 height=496 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674200/extras/819f4208e4e48f098bd638f92200355f.webm?t=1786636382\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674200/extras/819f4208e4e48f098bd638f92200355f.mp4?t=1786636382\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Life in Alaska requires strategy and proper preparation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources and craft useful items in different workshops such as:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >tool workshop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >carpentry workshop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >fur workshop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >campfire and kitchen</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Preparing meals and resting provides bonuses that increase work efficiency, cold resistance, and character stamina.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Hunt Wild Animals</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674200/extras/0581468270afeb05aaf198b91dd7bfa1.poster.avif?t=1786636382\" width=1170 height=496 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674200/extras/0581468270afeb05aaf198b91dd7bfa1.webm?t=1786636382\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674200/extras/0581468270afeb05aaf198b91dd7bfa1.mp4?t=1786636382\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The wild nature of Alaska is both a threat and a valuable source of resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By hunting animals you can obtain:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >meat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >hides</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >furs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >hunting trophies</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The quality of the materials you obtain depends on the weapon used and your hunting skills.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Fight Extreme Cold</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674200/extras/bf66864e0eb08602ceccb7d3631af978.poster.avif?t=1786636382\" width=1170 height=496 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674200/extras/bf66864e0eb08602ceccb7d3631af978.webm?t=1786636382\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674200/extras/bf66864e0eb08602ceccb7d3631af978.mp4?t=1786636382\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you venture into the Alaskan wilderness, the lower the temperature becomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To survive in the extreme climate you must:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >wear warmer clothing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >prepare proper meals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >manage your energy and stamina</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lack of preparation can quickly end your expedition.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Build Your Own Businesses</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674200/extras/f749a3f331bfb8104433832d21af4d11.poster.avif?t=1786636382\" width=1170 height=496 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674200/extras/f749a3f331bfb8104433832d21af4d11.webm?t=1786636382\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674200/extras/f749a3f331bfb8104433832d21af4d11.mp4?t=1786636382\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gold mining is only the beginning. You can develop different ventures and build your own economic empire:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >new mines</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >farms producing food and milk</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a hotel for travelers and gold prospectors</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire workers, manage production, and expand your enterprises.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Automate Your Mines</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674200/extras/f07f41321dea620949ae83f1ca402ef2.poster.avif?t=1786636382\" width=1170 height=496 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674200/extras/f07f41321dea620949ae83f1ca402ef2.webm?t=1786636382\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674200/extras/f07f41321dea620949ae83f1ca402ef2.mp4?t=1786636382\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The largest mines can be transformed into real enterprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire miners who will work for you and generate a steady income.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This allows you to focus on exploration, business development, and discovering new lands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64 bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 / AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060 6GB / AMD Radeon RX 580<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 15 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64 bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7 13th generation / Ryzen 7 4th generation<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce RTX 4060 / AMD equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 15 GB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Action","Adventure","Casual","Indie","RPG","Simulation","Strategy"],"developers":["Baked Games"],"publishers":["Baked Games S.A.","PlayWay S.A."],"release_date":"Apr 14, 2026"}